  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758953,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Lines Princess: A MSX Adventure\n\nStep into a captivating sequel to the acclaimed 10 Lines Hero! In *10 Lines Princess*, the roles are reversed. The hero, having previously rescued the princess, is now imprisoned, and it's up to her to embark on a perilous quest to save him. Developed for the BASIC 10Liner 2023 contest, this MSX game builds upon the foundation of its predecessor with enhanced gameplay and innovative mechanics.\n\nNavigate challenging levels filled with hazards and formidable enemies. A unique color-changing mechanic allows you to absorb enemy colors, granting immunity to specific dangers and boosting your healing abilities.  Expect a refined and more complex experience than the original, with new obstacles and strategic opportunities. \n\nCan the princess overcome the trials ahead and rescue her valiant savior?  Experience a compelling narrative, tight controls, and a rewarding sense of accomplishment in this cleverly designed, line-limited adventure for the MSX platform. Prepare for a fresh perspective on a beloved formula!"
    },
